      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    eur_notional = 5_000_000\n    contracted_gbp_per_eur = 0.7400\n    current_spot_bid = 0.7342\n    three_month_forward_bid_points = 14.0 / 10_000\n    gbp_90_day_libor = 0.0058\n    days = 90\n    basis = 360\n\n    # Calculate the current three-month GBP/EUR forward bid rate\n    current_forward_bid = current_spot_bid + three_month_forward_bid_points\n\n    # Calculate and discount the mark-to-market gain in GBP\n    undiscounted_gain = eur_notional * (\n        contracted_gbp_per_eur - current_forward_bid\n    )\n    discount_factor = 1 + gbp_90_day_libor * days / basis\n    mark_to_market_gain = undiscounted_gain / discount_factor\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(mark_to_market_gain, 3)\n```",
